  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><color=#FBBF24>CHOOSE A SCENARIO</color></b>\nUse the keyboard on the
    desk: <b>\u25C4 \u25BA</b> or <b>1 2 3</b> to choose, <b>ENTER</b> to start.\n\n<b>Headset</b> 
    poke the keys with a fingertip, or point and pull the trigger.\n<b>Desktop</b> 
    arrow keys and Enter, or click the desk keys. Move the mouse to look around.\n<b>Phone</b> 
    tap the keypad or the desk keys.\n\n<b><color=#FBBF24>EXPLORE THE ROOM</color></b>\n<b>Desktop</b> 
    press <b>R</b> to stand up: WASD to walk, Shift to run, right-drag to look, click
    the floor to walk there. Click the chair or press R to sit down again.\n<b>Headset</b> 
    left stick to walk, right stick to turn and teleport; up the stairs to the gallery.
    Point at the chair (hands: turn your left palm up, SIT AT DESK) to return.\n<b>Phone</b> 
    STAND UP, then tap the floor to walk and drag to look.\n\n<b><color=#FBBF24>01
    \xB7 DEADLOCK</color></b>\nA parking lot where cars (processes) compete for bays
    (resources). Watch a deadlock form, detect it, break it, then learn to avoid
    it with the Banker's Algorithm.\n<b><color=#FBBF24>02 \xB7 CPU SCHEDULING</color></b> 
    a lab where processes queue for one CPU core: FCFS, SRTF, Priority, Round Robin.\n<b><color=#FBBF24>03
    \xB7 MEMORY</color></b>  a warehouse where pallets are frames and boxes are pages:
    FIFO, LRU, Optimal.\n\nOpen this menu any time with <b>Esc</b>, the <b>\u2261
    MENU</b> button, or the controller's <b>\u2261</b> button."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
